  {
   "key": "start",
   "name": {
    "en": "Start Here",
    "de": "Start"
   },
   "kind": "guide",
   "lines": [
    {
     "en": "# Paycheck & Monthly Budget",
     "de": "# Haushaltsbuch"
    },
    {
     "en": "Know what is safe to spend until your next payday, and where every dollar went.",
     "de": "Wisse, was du bis zum nächsten Gehalt noch ausgeben kannst, und wohin jeder Euro ging."
    },
    {
     "en": "",
     "de": ""
    },
    {
     "en": "## Start in three steps",
     "de": "## In drei Schritten loslegen"
    },
    {
     "en": "1. Settings: pick the month to show, your next payday and your savings goal.",
     "de": "1. Einstellungen: Wähle den Monat, deinen nächsten Zahltag und dein Sparziel."
    },
    {
     "en": "2. Categories: rename the categories and set a monthly budget for each.",
     "de": "2. Kategorien: Benenne die Kategorien um und lege für jede ein Monatsbudget fest."
    },
    {
     "en": "3. Log: add every payment and income. Spending is negative, income positive, as on your bank statement.",
     "de": "3. Buchungen: Trage jede Ausgabe und Einnahme ein. Ausgaben sind negativ, Einnahmen positiv, wie auf dem Kontoauszug."
    },
    {
     "en": "",
     "de": ""
    },
    {
     "en": "## What each tab does",
     "de": "## Was jedes Blatt tut"
    },
    {
     "en": "Dashboard: income, spending, what is left and safe to spend per day until payday.",
     "de": "Übersicht: Einnahmen, Ausgaben, was übrig ist und was du bis zum Zahltag pro Tag ausgeben kannst."
    },
    {
     "en": "Year: what each category cost in every month of the year.",
     "de": "Jahr: was jede Kategorie in jedem Monat des Jahres gekostet hat."
    },
    {
     "en": "Tinted cells are yours to fill; everything else computes itself. Nothing is locked.",
     "de": "Getönte Zellen füllst du aus, alles andere rechnet sich selbst. Nichts ist gesperrt."
    },
    {
     "en": "Made a mistake? File > Version history brings back any earlier state.",
     "de": "Etwas verrechnet? Datei > Versionsverlauf holt jeden früheren Stand zurück."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "settings",
   "name": {
    "en": "Settings",
    "de": "Einstellungen"
   },
   "kind": "form",
   "cells": [
    {
     "name": "month",
     "label": {
      "en": "Month to show",
      "de": "Angezeigter Monat"
     },
     "type": "date",
     "value": "2026-10-01",
     "note": {
      "en": "Any day of the month works.",
      "de": "Jeder Tag des Monats geht."
     }
    },
    {
     "name": "payday",
     "label": {
      "en": "Next payday",
      "de": "Nächster Zahltag"
     },
     "type": "date",
     "value": "2026-10-31"
    },
    {
     "name": "savings_rate",
     "label": {
      "en": "Savings goal, share of income",
      "de": "Sparziel, Anteil am Einkommen"
     },
     "type": "percent",
     "value": 0.1
    },
    {
     "name": "month_start",
     "label": {
      "en": "First day",
      "de": "Erster Tag"
     },
     "type": "date",
     "formula": "=DATE(YEAR([month]),MONTH([month]),1)"
    },
    {
     "name": "month_end",
     "label": {
      "en": "Last day",
      "de": "Letzter Tag"
     },
     "type": "date",
     "formula": "=EOMONTH([month],0)"
    },
    {
     "name": "year",
     "label": {
      "en": "Year",
      "de": "Jahr"
     },
     "type": "number",
     "formula": "=YEAR([month])"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
